WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.540
We wholly recommend Vlad and his team.

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.460
They waterproofed our two sides of our bungalow.

3
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:09.380
Over two days, they dug down to the foundation,

4
00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.220
replaced the weeping tile, ticked many cracks,

5
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.220
waterproofed, and backfilled to the original depth.

6
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.780
We are extremely happy with Vlad and his team.

7
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:20.540
They worked hard and got the job done

8
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:26.200
within the timeframes and expectations.

9
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.360
And here's the finished.
